--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Downloaded software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The servers and runtimes pinned in configs/servers/ are not part of this repository and are not redistributed with it
or its releases. `bbench fetch` downloads them onto the user's machine and verifies each by sha256. Each stays under its
own license. Bedrock Dedicated Server is downloaded from Mojang only after the user accepts the Minecraft End User
License Agreement.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party software
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The load bots (bots/) are built against gophertunnel and go-raknet. The release binaries, loadbot and legacy1001,
contain code from these projects and from their module dependencies; `go version -m <binary>` lists every module
compiled into a binary. The patch bots/legacy1001/0001-login-backport.patch is derived from gophertunnel and remains
under its MIT license, as does the gophertunnel fork that legacy1001 is built against.

The Dragonfly helper (configs/servers/dragonfly/) is built against Dragonfly by `bbench fetch` on the user's machine.
It is not released as a binary.

